    "detailed_description": "A young girl and her goat friend explore a world where the stars have fallen to earth. Nightscape is a 2.5D atmospheric adventure where you wield stellar powers, explore an ancient Arabian land, and overcome deadly creatures. Help Layla return the stars to the sky and find her missing father.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/2417b8a408bdab25aecfad3a8d114f8c.poster.avif?t=1741689870\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/2417b8a408bdab25aecfad3a8d114f8c.webm?t=1741689870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/2417b8a408bdab25aecfad3a8d114f8c.mp4?t=1741689870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Welcome to an odyssey inspired by stars and ancient Arabian culture.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/64229d2e340474b628b8f3e7df2605fe.poster.avif?t=1741689870\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/64229d2e340474b628b8f3e7df2605fe.webm?t=1741689870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/64229d2e340474b628b8f3e7df2605fe.mp4?t=1741689870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You are Layla, a young stargazer who inherits your father's passion for astronomy, who went missing after the mysterious Starfall.<br>Before you stands a chaotic world and an opportunity to restore it.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/14a98e6bacc90be11535bb1a12e88b03.poster.avif?t=1741689870\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/14a98e6bacc90be11535bb1a12e88b03.webm?t=1741689870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/14a98e6bacc90be11535bb1a12e88b03.mp4?t=1741689870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/31f7144159694fb95263d1837805d468.poster.avif?t=1741689870\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/31f7144159694fb95263d1837805d468.webm?t=1741689870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/31f7144159694fb95263d1837805d468.mp4?t=1741689870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Time to utilize your wit, courage, and knowledge of constellation powers, and don\u2019t forget about your loyal companion, the Goat Kid!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/f7c0a95a938798f30553b599cb171184.poster.avif?t=1741689870\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/f7c0a95a938798f30553b599cb171184.webm?t=1741689870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/f7c0a95a938798f30553b599cb171184.mp4?t=1741689870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "A young girl and her goat friend explore a world where the stars have fallen to earth. Nightscape is a 2.5D atmospheric adventure where you wield stellar powers, explore an ancient Arabian land, and overcome deadly creatures. Help Layla return the stars to the sky and find her missing father.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/2417b8a408bdab25aecfad3a8d114f8c.poster.avif?t=1741689870\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/2417b8a408bdab25aecfad3a8d114f8c.webm?t=1741689870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/2417b8a408bdab25aecfad3a8d114f8c.mp4?t=1741689870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Welcome to an odyssey inspired by stars and ancient Arabian culture.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/64229d2e340474b628b8f3e7df2605fe.poster.avif?t=1741689870\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/64229d2e340474b628b8f3e7df2605fe.webm?t=1741689870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/64229d2e340474b628b8f3e7df2605fe.mp4?t=1741689870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You are Layla, a young stargazer who inherits your father's passion for astronomy, who went missing after the mysterious Starfall.<br>Before you stands a chaotic world and an opportunity to restore it.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/14a98e6bacc90be11535bb1a12e88b03.poster.avif?t=1741689870\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/14a98e6bacc90be11535bb1a12e88b03.webm?t=1741689870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/14a98e6bacc90be11535bb1a12e88b03.mp4?t=1741689870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/31f7144159694fb95263d1837805d468.poster.avif?t=1741689870\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/31f7144159694fb95263d1837805d468.webm?t=1741689870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/31f7144159694fb95263d1837805d468.mp4?t=1741689870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Time to utilize your wit, courage, and knowledge of constellation powers, and don\u2019t forget about your loyal companion, the Goat Kid!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/f7c0a95a938798f30553b599cb171184.poster.avif?t=1741689870\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/f7c0a95a938798f30553b599cb171184.webm?t=1741689870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/f7c0a95a938798f30553b599cb171184.mp4?t=1741689870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
